    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Where to find deeper history",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 36, "w": 24, "h": 5 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard surfaces only the live current-state metrics that `mm404/tautulli-exporter` re-emits from the Tautulli API — bandwidth in kbps and the playback-mode breakdown that `axsuul/plex-media-server-exporter` (used by the **Plex — Overview** dashboard) does **not** expose.\n\nFor historical analytics — per-user watch time, top titles, daily playcount trends, viewing history charts — open the Tautulli UI directly at [tautulli.frame.chalupatech.com](https://tautulli.frame.chalupatech.com). Tautulli persists that data in its own SQLite database; the exporter does not surface it.\n\nFor general Plex health (server up/version, library counts, transcode sanity checks) see the **Plex — Overview** dashboard."
      }
    }
